{
  "tema": 5268,
  "slug": "veia-imperfecto-ver",
  "titulo": "Ver in the imperfect",
  "subtitulo": "De niño veía caricaturas todos los sábados.",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Ver is one of only three irregular verbs in the imperfect: it keeps the e of its stem, so it is veía, veías, veía, veíamos, veían (never vía).",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ver** (_to see, to watch_) is one of only **three irregular verbs** in the imperfect (with **ser** and **ir**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The irregularity is small: regular -er verbs drop -er and add -ía (com**ía**), but **ver keeps its e**: **ve** + **ía**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "ve",
            "+",
            "-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "Imperfect of ver"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**veía**"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "**veías**"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**veía**"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros, nosotras",
              "**veíamos**"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ellas, ustedes",
              "**veían**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Every form has an accent on the **í**. **Yo** and **él** look the same: **veía**; context or the pronoun tells them apart."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Use it for what you **used to see or watch**, and for background: what you **were seeing** at the time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "De niño ==veía== caricaturas todos los sábados.",
              "en": "As a kid I used to watch cartoons every Saturday."
            },
            {
              "es": "Desde la azotea ==veíamos== el mar.",
              "en": "From the rooftop we used to see the sea."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Veías== The Expanse cuando vivías en San Diego?",
              "en": "Did you use to watch The Expanse when you lived in San Diego?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi abuela ==veía== la telenovela todas las noches.",
              "en": "My grandma used to watch the soap opera every night."
            },
            {
              "es": "Antes mis tíos ==veían== el fútbol en nuestra casa.",
              "en": "My uncles used to watch soccer at our house."
            },
            {
              "es": "Sin lentes no ==veía== nada.",
              "en": "Without glasses I couldn't see a thing."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ustedes ==veían== a Beto en el gimnasio?",
              "en": "Did you all use to see Beto at the gym?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
